###Mapping

// ============================================================================================
// firm_balance_sheet::Mapping -- 33 sets, three of them filter subtypes, four on views
// ============================================================================================
// THREE INCLUDES, and this mapping needs all three: a class-valued property mapping may only
// name a set that exists in THIS mapping's scope, and `[pnlLine]`, `[exaNetExposure]` and
// `[lqvHqlaLevel]` come from three different dependencies.
//
// The same diamond as the store, one layer up: pnl_attribution::Mapping and
// liquidity_view::Mapping both include core_account::Mapping transitively, and
// valuation_core::Mapping and cash_core::Mapping both include core_types::Mapping. Reaching
// one mapping by two routes resolves to one mapping. Including any of them HERE would be both
// redundant and a reference to an undeclared project, and this file does not do it -- no
// `core_`, `position_keeping`, `valuation_core`, `credit_core`, `collateral_core`, `cash_core`
// or `funding_core` package name appears anywhere below.
//
// EVERY REFERENCE TO THIS PROJECT'S OWN COLUMNS IS FOUR SEGMENTS DEEP, because this project
// owns a schema: `[firm_balance_sheet::Store]fbs.FBS_LINE_ITEM.LINE_ID` -- store, schema,
// table, column. The three dependencies put their tables in the default schema, so theirs are
// `[pnl_attribution::Store]PNL_LINE.CLOSING_MARKET_VALUE` with no schema segment. Getting that
// wrong is the commonest way a schema-owning project fails to compile, and the error names
// the column rather than the missing schema.
//
// EVERY TARGET SET ID IS NAMED. `netExposure[exaNetExposure]: ...@Fbs_LineNetExposure` and not
// the bare `netExposure: ...`, because all three dependencies name their set ids explicitly,
// which means the DEFAULT ids (`exposure_agg_ExaNetExposure` and the rest) do not exist. The
// ids used here are read from the three MANIFESTs, not guessed:
//
//    pnl-attribution  pnlLine, pnlRunTotal, pnlRun          (pnlRun is PnlAttributionRun)
//    exposure-agg     exaNetExposure, exaNettingSet, exaCollateralPosition,
//                     exaCounterpartyDayNet, exaRun          (exaRun is ExaExposureRun)
//    liquidity-view   lqvHqlaLevel, lqvHolding, lqvLcrResult, lqvNsfrResult
//                                                            (lqvHolding is LqvHqlaHolding)
//
// THE FILTER SUBTYPES. `[fbsLineItem]` is the ROOT set (`*`) over fbs.FBS_LINE_ITEM: an
// unqualified `FbsLineItem.all()` is the whole statement, all three sides. Three sets extend
// it, each adding one `~filter` and only the columns that mean something once the row's side
// is known. None of them restates the key, the main table, or the inherited property mappings.
// A property declared on a SUBCLASS cannot be mapped on the parent's set -- `unencumbered
// Amount` is FbsAssetLine's, so it is mapped in `[fbsAssetLine]` and nowhere else.
//
// FOUR SETS ARE ROOTED AT VIEWS, not tables. Their `~mainTable` is a `~groupBy` view and their
// `~primaryKey` names the grouping columns, because that is the grain the view produces.
//
// SET IDS ARE A GLOBAL NAMESPACE across all fifty-odd projects. Every one below is explicit
// and `fbs`-prefixed, so the default ids (`firm_balance_sheet_FbsLineItem`) do not exist and a
// downstream `extends [...]` or cross-project `AssociationMapping` must name the explicit one.
Mapping firm_balance_sheet::Mapping
(
   include pnl_attribution::Mapping
   include exposure_agg::Mapping
   include liquidity_view::Mapping

   // ---- the statement --------------------------------------------------------------------
   // Two of the class-valued properties here leave the project entirely, and both land on a
   // dependency's `~groupBy` VIEW rather than a row: `pnlRunTotal` is the firm's whole day of
   // P&L as one row, `nsfrResult` is the one-year funding ratio. Neither is recomputed here.
   firm_balance_sheet::FbsBalanceSheet[fbsStatement]: Relational
   {
      ~primaryKey
      (
         [firm_balance_sheet::Store]fbs.FBS_STATEMENT.INSTITUTION_ID,
         [firm_balance_sheet::Store]fbs.FBS_STATEMENT.AS_OF_DATE,
         [firm_balance_sheet::Store]fbs.FBS_STATEMENT.REPORTING_CURRENCY
      )
      ~mainTable [firm_balance_sheet::Store]fbs.FBS_STATEMENT
      institutionId: [firm_balance_sheet::Store]fbs.FBS_STATEMENT.INSTITUTION_ID,
      asOfDate: [firm_balance_sheet::Store]fbs.FBS_STATEMENT.AS_OF_DATE,
      reportingCurrency: [firm_balance_sheet::Store]fbs.FBS_STATEMENT.REPORTING_CURRENCY,
      basisOfPreparation: [firm_balance_sheet::Store]fbs.FBS_STATEMENT.BASIS_OF_PREPARATION,
      consolidationScope: [firm_balance_sheet::Store]fbs.FBS_STATEMENT.CONSOLIDATION_SCOPE,
      statementStatus: [firm_balance_sheet::Store]fbs.FBS_STATEMENT.STATEMENT_STATUS,
      runId: [firm_balance_sheet::Store]fbs.FBS_STATEMENT.RUN_ID,
      pnlAttributionId: [firm_balance_sheet::Store]fbs.FBS_STATEMENT.PNL_ATTRIBUTION_ID,
      nsfrScenarioCurrency: [firm_balance_sheet::Store]fbs.FBS_STATEMENT.NSFR_SCENARIO_CURRENCY,
      totalAssets: [firm_balance_sheet::Store]fbs.FBS_STATEMENT.TOTAL_ASSETS,
      totalLiabilities: [firm_balance_sheet::Store]fbs.FBS_STATEMENT.TOTAL_LIABILITIES,
      totalEquity: [firm_balance_sheet::Store]fbs.FBS_STATEMENT.TOTAL_EQUITY,
      preparedBy: [firm_balance_sheet::Store]fbs.FBS_STATEMENT.PREPARED_BY,
      preparedAt: [firm_balance_sheet::Store]fbs.FBS_STATEMENT.PREPARED_AT,
      signedOffOn: [firm_balance_sheet::Store]fbs.FBS_STATEMENT.SIGNED_OFF_ON,
      run[fbsRun]: [firm_balance_sheet::Store]@Fbs_StatementRun,
      lines[fbsLineItem]: [firm_balance_sheet::Store]@Fbs_LineStatement,
      sideTotals[fbsSideTotal]: [firm_balance_sheet::Store]@Fbs_StatementSideTotal,
      categoryTotals[fbsCategoryTotal]: [firm_balance_sheet::Store]@Fbs_StatementCategoryTotal,
      balanceChecks[fbsBalanceCheck]: [firm_balance_sheet::Store]@Fbs_StatementBalanceCheck,
      attestations[fbsAttestation]: [firm_balance_sheet::Store]@Fbs_StatementAttestation,
      retainedEarnings[fbsRetainedEarnings]: [firm_balance_sheet::Store]@Fbs_StatementRetainedEarnings,
      hqlaStock[fbsHqlaStock]: [firm_balance_sheet::Store]@Fbs_StatementHqlaStock,
      equityBalances[fbsEquityBalance]: [firm_balance_sheet::Store]@Fbs_StatementEquityBalance,
      pnlRunTotal[pnlRunTotal]: [firm_balance_sheet::Store]@Fbs_StatementPnlRunTotal,
      nsfrResult[lqvNsfrResult]: [firm_balance_sheet::Store]@Fbs_StatementNsfrResult
   }

   firm_balance_sheet::FbsBalanceSheetRun[fbsRun]: Relational
   {
      ~primaryKey ( [firm_balance_sheet::Store]fbs.FBS_RUN.RUN_ID )
      ~mainTable [firm_balance_sheet::Store]fbs.FBS_RUN
      runId: [firm_balance_sheet::Store]fbs.FBS_RUN.RUN_ID,
      asOfDate: [firm_balance_sheet::Store]fbs.FBS_RUN.AS_OF_DATE,
      runType: [firm_balance_sheet::Store]fbs.FBS_RUN.RUN_TYPE,
      runStatus: [firm_balance_sheet::Store]fbs.FBS_RUN.RUN_STATUS,
      startedAt: [firm_balance_sheet::Store]fbs.FBS_RUN.STARTED_AT,
      completedAt: [firm_balance_sheet::Store]fbs.FBS_RUN.COMPLETED_AT,
      lineCount: [firm_balance_sheet::Store]fbs.FBS_RUN.LINE_COUNT,
      rejectedLineCount: [firm_balance_sheet::Store]fbs.FBS_RUN.REJECTED_LINE_COUNT,
      exposureRunId: [firm_balance_sheet::Store]fbs.FBS_RUN.EXPOSURE_RUN_ID,
      pnlAttributionId: [firm_balance_sheet::Store]fbs.FBS_RUN.PNL_ATTRIBUTION_ID,
      triggeredBy: [firm_balance_sheet::Store]fbs.FBS_RUN.TRIGGERED_BY,
      statements[fbsStatement]: [firm_balance_sheet::Store]@Fbs_StatementRun,
      lines[fbsLineItem]: [firm_balance_sheet::Store]@Fbs_LineRun,
      pnlRun[pnlRun]: [firm_balance_sheet::Store]@Fbs_RunPnlRun,
      exposureRun[exaRun]: [firm_balance_sheet::Store]@Fbs_RunExposureRun
   }

   // ---- the line grain, and the three sides ----------------------------------------------
   // THE ROOT SET. Unqualified, `FbsLineItem.all()` is every row of every side.
   *firm_balance_sheet::FbsLineItem[fbsLineItem]: Relational
   {
      ~primaryKey ( [firm_balance_sheet::Store]fbs.FBS_LINE_ITEM.LINE_ID )
      ~mainTable [firm_balance_sheet::Store]fbs.FBS_LINE_ITEM
      lineId: [firm_balance_sheet::Store]fbs.FBS_LINE_ITEM.LINE_ID,
      institutionId: [firm_balance_sheet::Store]fbs.FBS_LINE_ITEM.INSTITUTION_ID,
      asOfDate: [firm_balance_sheet::Store]fbs.FBS_LINE_ITEM.AS_OF_DATE,
      reportingCurrency: [firm_balance_sheet::Store]fbs.FBS_LINE_ITEM.REPORTING_CURRENCY,
      side: [firm_balance_sheet::Store]fbs.FBS_LINE_ITEM.SIDE,
      categoryCode: [firm_balance_sheet::Store]fbs.FBS_LINE_ITEM.CATEGORY_CODE,
      basisCode: [firm_balance_sheet::Store]fbs.FBS_LINE_ITEM.BASIS_CODE,
      bookCode: [firm_balance_sheet::Store]fbs.FBS_LINE_ITEM.BOOK_CODE,
      fairValueLevel: [firm_balance_sheet::Store]fbs.FBS_LINE_ITEM.FAIR_VALUE_LEVEL,
      carryingAmount: [firm_balance_sheet::Store]fbs.FBS_LINE_ITEM.CARRYING_AMOUNT,
      grossAmount: [firm_balance_sheet::Store]fbs.FBS_LINE_ITEM.GROSS_AMOUNT,
      impairmentAmount: [firm_balance_sheet::Store]fbs.FBS_LINE_ITEM.IMPAIRMENT_AMOUNT,
      priorCarryingAmount: [firm_balance_sheet::Store]fbs.FBS_LINE_ITEM.PRIOR_CARRYING_AMOUNT,
      localCurrency: [firm_balance_sheet::Store]fbs.FBS_LINE_ITEM.LOCAL_CURRENCY,
      localAmount: [firm_balance_sheet::Store]fbs.FBS_LINE_ITEM.LOCAL_AMOUNT,
      fxRate: [firm_balance_sheet::Store]fbs.FBS_LINE_ITEM.FX_RATE,
      runId: [firm_balance_sheet::Store]fbs.FBS_LINE_ITEM.RUN_ID,
      statement[fbsStatement]: [firm_balance_sheet::Store]@Fbs_LineStatement,
      category[fbsCategory]: [firm_balance_sheet::Store]@Fbs_LineCategory,
      basis[fbsMeasurementBasis]: [firm_balance_sheet::Store]@Fbs_LineBasis,
      book[fbsBookClassification]: [firm_balance_sheet::Store]@Fbs_LineBook,
      valuationLevel[fbsFairValueLevel]: [firm_balance_sheet::Store]@Fbs_LineFairValueLevel,
      run[fbsRun]: [firm_balance_sheet::Store]@Fbs_LineRun,
      adjustments[fbsAdjustment]: [firm_balance_sheet::Store]@Fbs_LineAdjustment,
      categoryTotal[fbsCategoryTotal]: [firm_balance_sheet::Store]@Fbs_LineCategoryTotal,
      basisTotal[fbsBasisTotal]: [firm_balance_sheet::Store]@Fbs_LineBasisTotal,
      bookTotal[fbsBookTotal]: [firm_balance_sheet::Store]@Fbs_LineBookTotal,
      sideTotal[fbsSideTotal]: [firm_balance_sheet::Store]@Fbs_LineSideTotal,
      netExposure[exaNetExposure]: [firm_balance_sheet::Store]@Fbs_LineNetExposure
   }

   // The left-hand side. `hqlaHolding` leaves the project: the same asset as liquidity-view
   // knows it, under a different taxonomy and a different haircut.
   firm_balance_sheet::FbsAssetLine[fbsAssetLine] extends [fbsLineItem]: Relational
   {
      ~filter [firm_balance_sheet::Store]FbsAssetRows
      isHqla: [firm_balance_sheet::Store]fbs.FBS_LINE_ITEM.IS_HQLA,
      hqlaLevelCode: [firm_balance_sheet::Store]fbs.FBS_LINE_ITEM.HQLA_LEVEL_CODE,
      encumberedAmount: [firm_balance_sheet::Store]fbs.FBS_LINE_ITEM.ENCUMBERED_AMOUNT,
      liquidityDays: [firm_balance_sheet::Store]fbs.FBS_LINE_ITEM.LIQUIDITY_DAYS,
      hqlaHoldingId: [firm_balance_sheet::Store]fbs.FBS_LINE_ITEM.HQLA_HOLDING_ID,
      hqlaHolding[lqvHolding]: [firm_balance_sheet::Store]@Fbs_AssetLineHqlaHolding
   }

   firm_balance_sheet::FbsLiabilityLine[fbsLiabilityLine] extends [fbsLineItem]: Relational
   {
      ~filter [firm_balance_sheet::Store]FbsLiabilityRows
      maturityDate: [firm_balance_sheet::Store]fbs.FBS_LINE_ITEM.MATURITY_DATE,
      isSecured: [firm_balance_sheet::Store]fbs.FBS_LINE_ITEM.IS_SECURED,
      fundingType: [firm_balance_sheet::Store]fbs.FBS_LINE_ITEM.FUNDING_TYPE,
      counterpartyId: [firm_balance_sheet::Store]fbs.FBS_LINE_ITEM.COUNTERPARTY_ID,
      isDemandDeposit: [firm_balance_sheet::Store]fbs.FBS_LINE_ITEM.IS_DEMAND_DEPOSIT
   }

   firm_balance_sheet::FbsEquityLine[fbsEquityLine] extends [fbsLineItem]: Relational
   {
      ~filter [firm_balance_sheet::Store]FbsEquityRows
      equityComponentCode: [firm_balance_sheet::Store]fbs.FBS_LINE_ITEM.EQUITY_COMPONENT_CODE,
      isCet1Eligible: [firm_balance_sheet::Store]fbs.FBS_LINE_ITEM.IS_CET1_ELIGIBLE,
      nonControllingInterest: [firm_balance_sheet::Store]fbs.FBS_LINE_ITEM.NON_CONTROLLING_INTEREST
   }

   // ---- the classifiers -------------------------------------------------------------------
   firm_balance_sheet::FbsCategory[fbsCategory]: Relational
   {
      ~primaryKey ( [firm_balance_sheet::Store]fbs.FBS_CATEGORY.CATEGORY_CODE )
      ~mainTable [firm_balance_sheet::Store]fbs.FBS_CATEGORY
      categoryCode: [firm_balance_sheet::Store]fbs.FBS_CATEGORY.CATEGORY_CODE,
      categoryName: [firm_balance_sheet::Store]fbs.FBS_CATEGORY.CATEGORY_NAME,
      parentCode: [firm_balance_sheet::Store]fbs.FBS_CATEGORY.PARENT_CODE,
      side: [firm_balance_sheet::Store]fbs.FBS_CATEGORY.SIDE,
      statementOrder: [firm_balance_sheet::Store]fbs.FBS_CATEGORY.STATEMENT_ORDER,
      isSubtotal: [firm_balance_sheet::Store]fbs.FBS_CATEGORY.IS_SUBTOTAL,
      noteReference: [firm_balance_sheet::Store]fbs.FBS_CATEGORY.NOTE_REFERENCE,
      retiredOn: [firm_balance_sheet::Store]fbs.FBS_CATEGORY.RETIRED_ON,
      lines[fbsLineItem]: [firm_balance_sheet::Store]@Fbs_LineCategory,
      totals[fbsCategoryTotal]: [firm_balance_sheet::Store]@Fbs_CategoryCategoryTotal
   }

   firm_balance_sheet::FbsMeasurementBasis[fbsMeasurementBasis]: Relational
   {
      ~primaryKey ( [firm_balance_sheet::Store]fbs.FBS_MEASUREMENT_BASIS.BASIS_CODE )
      ~mainTable [firm_balance_sheet::Store]fbs.FBS_MEASUREMENT_BASIS
      basisCode: [firm_balance_sheet::Store]fbs.FBS_MEASUREMENT_BASIS.BASIS_CODE,
      basisName: [firm_balance_sheet::Store]fbs.FBS_MEASUREMENT_BASIS.BASIS_NAME,
      standardReference: [firm_balance_sheet::Store]fbs.FBS_MEASUREMENT_BASIS.STANDARD_REFERENCE,
      movementsThrough: [firm_balance_sheet::Store]fbs.FBS_MEASUREMENT_BASIS.MOVEMENTS_THROUGH,
      isFairValue: [firm_balance_sheet::Store]fbs.FBS_MEASUREMENT_BASIS.IS_FAIR_VALUE,
      requiresEcl: [firm_balance_sheet::Store]fbs.FBS_MEASUREMENT_BASIS.REQUIRES_ECL,
      recyclesToPl: [firm_balance_sheet::Store]fbs.FBS_MEASUREMENT_BASIS.RECYCLES_TO_PL,
      lines[fbsLineItem]: [firm_balance_sheet::Store]@Fbs_LineBasis,
      basisTotals[fbsBasisTotal]: [firm_balance_sheet::Store]@Fbs_BasisBasisTotal,
      ociReserves[fbsOciReserve]: [firm_balance_sheet::Store]@Fbs_OciReserveBasis
   }

   firm_balance_sheet::FbsBookClassification[fbsBookClassification]: Relational
   {
      ~primaryKey ( [firm_balance_sheet::Store]fbs.FBS_BOOK_CLASSIFICATION.BOOK_CODE )
      ~mainTable [firm_balance_sheet::Store]fbs.FBS_BOOK_CLASSIFICATION
      bookCode: [firm_balance_sheet::Store]fbs.FBS_BOOK_CLASSIFICATION.BOOK_CODE,
      bookName: [firm_balance_sheet::Store]fbs.FBS_BOOK_CLASSIFICATION.BOOK_NAME,
      intent: [firm_balance_sheet::Store]fbs.FBS_BOOK_CLASSIFICATION.INTENT,
      isTrading: [firm_balance_sheet::Store]fbs.FBS_BOOK_CLASSIFICATION.IS_TRADING,
      defaultBasisCode: [firm_balance_sheet::Store]fbs.FBS_BOOK_CLASSIFICATION.DEFAULT_BASIS_CODE,
      capitalTreatment: [firm_balance_sheet::Store]fbs.FBS_BOOK_CLASSIFICATION.CAPITAL_TREATMENT,
      boundaryPolicyRef: [firm_balance_sheet::Store]fbs.FBS_BOOK_CLASSIFICATION.BOUNDARY_POLICY_REF,
      defaultBasis[fbsMeasurementBasis]: [firm_balance_sheet::Store]@Fbs_BookDefaultBasis,
      lines[fbsLineItem]: [firm_balance_sheet::Store]@Fbs_LineBook,
      bookTotals[fbsBookTotal]: [firm_balance_sheet::Store]@Fbs_BookBookTotal
   }

   firm_balance_sheet::FbsFairValueLevel[fbsFairValueLevel]: Relational
   {
      ~primaryKey ( [firm_balance_sheet::Store]fbs.FBS_FAIR_VALUE_LEVEL.LEVEL_CODE )
      ~mainTable [firm_balance_sheet::Store]fbs.FBS_FAIR_VALUE_LEVEL
      levelCode: [firm_balance_sheet::Store]fbs.FBS_FAIR_VALUE_LEVEL.LEVEL_CODE,
      levelName: [firm_balance_sheet::Store]fbs.FBS_FAIR_VALUE_LEVEL.LEVEL_NAME,
      inputType: [firm_balance_sheet::Store]fbs.FBS_FAIR_VALUE_LEVEL.INPUT_TYPE,
      isObservable: [firm_balance_sheet::Store]fbs.FBS_FAIR_VALUE_LEVEL.IS_OBSERVABLE,
      requiresDisclosure: [firm_balance_sheet::Store]fbs.FBS_FAIR_VALUE_LEVEL.REQUIRES_DISCLOSURE,
      levelRank: [firm_balance_sheet::Store]fbs.FBS_FAIR_VALUE_LEVEL.LEVEL_RANK,
      lines[fbsLineItem]: [firm_balance_sheet::Store]@Fbs_LineFairValueLevel
   }

   // ---- trading book vs banking book -------------------------------------------------------
   // `pnlLine` is the deepest reference in this project: five columns into PNL_LINE, which is
   // pnl-attribution's own diamond apex over position-keeping and valuation-core. From here a
   // reader reaches `$position.pnlLine.position.instrument` -- five hops to core-instrument --
   // without this file naming any project it does not declare.
   firm_balance_sheet::FbsTradingBookPosition[fbsTradingPosition]: Relational
   {
      ~primaryKey ( [firm_balance_sheet::Store]fbs.FBS_TRADING_POSITION.LINE_ID )
      ~mainTable [firm_balance_sheet::Store]fbs.FBS_TRADING_POSITION
      lineId: [firm_balance_sheet::Store]fbs.FBS_TRADING_POSITION.LINE_ID,
      institutionId: [firm_balance_sheet::Store]fbs.FBS_TRADING_POSITION.INSTITUTION_ID,
      accountNo: [firm_balance_sheet::Store]fbs.FBS_TRADING_POSITION.ACCOUNT_NO,
      instrumentId: [firm_balance_sheet::Store]fbs.FBS_TRADING_POSITION.INSTRUMENT_ID,
      cobDate: [firm_balance_sheet::Store]fbs.FBS_TRADING_POSITION.COB_DATE,
      pnlAttributionId: [firm_balance_sheet::Store]fbs.FBS_TRADING_POSITION.PNL_ATTRIBUTION_ID,
      quantity: [firm_balance_sheet::Store]fbs.FBS_TRADING_POSITION.QUANTITY,
      fairValue: [firm_balance_sheet::Store]fbs.FBS_TRADING_POSITION.FAIR_VALUE,
      dayOneProfit: [firm_balance_sheet::Store]fbs.FBS_TRADING_POSITION.DAY_ONE_PROFIT,
      bidOfferReserve: [firm_balance_sheet::Store]fbs.FBS_TRADING_POSITION.BID_OFFER_RESERVE,
      modelReserve: [firm_balance_sheet::Store]fbs.FBS_TRADING_POSITION.MODEL_RESERVE,
      isLong: [firm_balance_sheet::Store]fbs.FBS_TRADING_POSITION.IS_LONG,
      deskCode: [firm_balance_sheet::Store]fbs.FBS_TRADING_POSITION.DESK_CODE,
      line[fbsLineItem]: [firm_balance_sheet::Store]@Fbs_LineTradingPosition,
      pnlLine[pnlLine]: [firm_balance_sheet::Store]@Fbs_TradingPositionPnlLine
   }

   firm_balance_sheet::FbsBankingBookAsset[fbsBankingAsset]: Relational
   {
      ~primaryKey ( [firm_balance_sheet::Store]fbs.FBS_BANKING_ASSET.LINE_ID )
      ~mainTable [firm_balance_sheet::Store]fbs.FBS_BANKING_ASSET
      lineId: [firm_balance_sheet::Store]fbs.FBS_BANKING_ASSET.LINE_ID,
      productType: [firm_balance_sheet::Store]fbs.FBS_BANKING_ASSET.PRODUCT_TYPE,
      originationDate: [firm_balance_sheet::Store]fbs.FBS_BANKING_ASSET.ORIGINATION_DATE,
      maturityDate: [firm_balance_sheet::Store]fbs.FBS_BANKING_ASSET.MATURITY_DATE,
      grossCarryingAmount: [firm_balance_sheet::Store]fbs.FBS_BANKING_ASSET.GROSS_CARRYING_AMOUNT,
      effectiveInterestRate: [firm_balance_sheet::Store]fbs.FBS_BANKING_ASSET.EFFECTIVE_INTEREST_RATE,
      unamortisedPremium: [firm_balance_sheet::Store]fbs.FBS_BANKING_ASSET.UNAMORTISED_PREMIUM,
      accruedInterest: [firm_balance_sheet::Store]fbs.FBS_BANKING_ASSET.ACCRUED_INTEREST,
      eclStage: [firm_balance_sheet::Store]fbs.FBS_BANKING_ASSET.ECL_STAGE,
      allowanceAmount: [firm_balance_sheet::Store]fbs.FBS_BANKING_ASSET.ALLOWANCE_AMOUNT,
      isPurchasedCreditImpaired: [firm_balance_sheet::Store]fbs.FBS_BANKING_ASSET.IS_PURCHASED_CREDIT_IMPAIRED,
      netExposureId: [firm_balance_sheet::Store]fbs.FBS_BANKING_ASSET.NET_EXPOSURE_ID,
      line[fbsLineItem]: [firm_balance_sheet::Store]@Fbs_LineBankingAsset,
      eclAllowances[fbsEclAllowance]: [firm_balance_sheet::Store]@Fbs_BankingAssetEcl,
      netExposure[exaNetExposure]: [firm_balance_sheet::Store]@Fbs_BankingAssetNetExposure
   }

   // ---- derivatives, before any netting ----------------------------------------------------
   firm_balance_sheet::FbsDerivativeAsset[fbsDerivativeAsset]: Relational
   {
      ~primaryKey ( [firm_balance_sheet::Store]fbs.FBS_DERIVATIVE_ASSET.DERIVATIVE_ASSET_ID )
      ~mainTable [firm_balance_sheet::Store]fbs.FBS_DERIVATIVE_ASSET
      derivativeAssetId: [firm_balance_sheet::Store]fbs.FBS_DERIVATIVE_ASSET.DERIVATIVE_ASSET_ID,
      institutionId: [firm_balance_sheet::Store]fbs.FBS_DERIVATIVE_ASSET.INSTITUTION_ID,
      asOfDate: [firm_balance_sheet::Store]fbs.FBS_DERIVATIVE_ASSET.AS_OF_DATE,
      nettingSetId: [firm_balance_sheet::Store]fbs.FBS_DERIVATIVE_ASSET.NETTING_SET_ID,
      netExposureId: [firm_balance_sheet::Store]fbs.FBS_DERIVATIVE_ASSET.NET_EXPOSURE_ID,
      counterpartyId: [firm_balance_sheet::Store]fbs.FBS_DERIVATIVE_ASSET.COUNTERPARTY_ID,
      productClass: [firm_balance_sheet::Store]fbs.FBS_DERIVATIVE_ASSET.PRODUCT_CLASS,
      notional: [firm_balance_sheet::Store]fbs.FBS_DERIVATIVE_ASSET.NOTIONAL,
      grossPositiveValue: [firm_balance_sheet::Store]fbs.FBS_DERIVATIVE_ASSET.GROSS_POSITIVE_VALUE,
      cvaAdjustment: [firm_balance_sheet::Store]fbs.FBS_DERIVATIVE_ASSET.CVA_ADJUSTMENT,
      fvaAdjustment: [firm_balance_sheet::Store]fbs.FBS_DERIVATIVE_ASSET.FVA_ADJUSTMENT,
      isCleared: [firm_balance_sheet::Store]fbs.FBS_DERIVATIVE_ASSET.IS_CLEARED,
      currency: [firm_balance_sheet::Store]fbs.FBS_DERIVATIVE_ASSET.CURRENCY,
      lineId: [firm_balance_sheet::Store]fbs.FBS_DERIVATIVE_ASSET.LINE_ID,
      line[fbsLineItem]: [firm_balance_sheet::Store]@Fbs_LineDerivativeAsset,
      netting[fbsNettingAdjustment]: [firm_balance_sheet::Store]@Fbs_DerivativeAssetNetting,
      nettingSet[exaNettingSet]: [firm_balance_sheet::Store]@Fbs_DerivativeAssetNettingSet,
      netExposure[exaNetExposure]: [firm_balance_sheet::Store]@Fbs_DerivativeAssetNetExposure,
      counterpartyDayNet[exaCounterpartyDayNet]: [firm_balance_sheet::Store]@Fbs_DerivativeAssetCounterpartyDayNet
   }

   firm_balance_sheet::FbsDerivativeLiability[fbsDerivativeLiability]: Relational
   {
